{"schema":"memento.relay-facts.v1","models":{"gemini-1.0-pro":{"n":"Gemini 1.0 Pro","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Gemini 1.0 Pro","s":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11805v1","https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/google-bard-try-gemini-ai/","https://blog.google/technology/ai/gemini-api-developers-cloud/"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Google","s":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11805v1","https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/google-bard-try-gemini-ai/","https://blog.google/technology/ai/gemini-api-developers-cloud/"]},{"k":"release","t":"2023-12-06","s":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11805v1","https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/google-bard-try-gemini-ai/","https://blog.google/technology/ai/gemini-api-developers-cloud/"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"32768","s":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11805v1","https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/google-bard-try-gemini-ai/","https://blog.google/technology/ai/gemini-api-developers-cloud/"]},{"k":"specs.languages","t":"Bardでは英語のみ。APIでは38言語のチャットに対応","s":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11805v1","https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/google-bard-try-gemini-ai/","https://blog.google/technology/ai/gemini-api-developers-cloud/"]},{"k":"family","t":"Gemini 1.0","s":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11805v1","https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/google-bard-try-gemini-ai/","https://blog.google/technology/ai/gemini-api-developers-cloud/"]},{"k":"status","t":"retired","s":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11805v1","https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/google-bard-try-gemini-ai/","https://blog.google/technology/ai/gemini-api-developers-cloud/"]},{"k":"availability.real","t":"none","s":["https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/learn/model-versions"]},{"k":"successor","t":"gemini-2.5-flash","s":["https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/learn/model-versions"]},{"k":"availability.retired_on","t":"2025-04-21","s":["https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/learn/model-versions"]},{"k":"summary","t":"Gemini 1.0 ProはGoogleのGemini 1.0世代の中位モデルで、2023年12月にBardに載り、その後APIでも公開された。見出しと箇条書きを使った明るい長文で答える一方、事実の取り違えや決まり文句の拒否、政治的な話題では検索を勧めてかわす癖が目立った。Bard（のちのGemini）の無料版を支えたあと、2025年4月までに引退した。","s":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11805v1","https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/google-bard-try-gemini-ai/","https://blog.google/technology/ai/gemini-api-developers-cloud/"]},{"k":"persona.interface.0","t":"chat","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-gemini-ai/"]},{"k":"persona.typical_strengths.0","t":"幅広い課題を対象とした、文章などの情報の理解。","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-gemini-ai/"]},{"k":"traits.knowledge.0","t":"基本的な事実（前年のアカデミー賞受賞者など）や人物の経歴を自信満々に取り違え、存在しない関与をでっちあげる（例：Charlie StrossがLinuxに貢献した、LLaMA 2はGoogle製）。","s":["https://techcrunch.com/2023/12/07/early-impressions-of-googles-gemini-arent-great/","https://lr.us.psf.lt/r/MachineLearning/comments/18c6xio/r_google_releases_the_gemini_family_of_frontier/kc9tzd6/?context=3","https://blog.gdeltproject.org/generative-ai-experiments-llm-secret-guardrails-how-gemini-pro-refuses-to-mention-openai-or-chatgpt/"]},{"k":"traits.safety.1","t":"選挙・時事・道徳比較など論争的な話題では立場を取らず、両論併記でぼかしたり「Googleで調べてください」と検索へ誘導したりする。","s":["https://arxiv.org/html/2312.11805v4","https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/google-bard-try-gemini-ai/","https://techcrunch.com/2023/12/07/early-impressions-of-googles-gemini-arent-great/"]}]},"openai/gpt-6-astra-pro":{"n":"GPT-6 Astra Pro","f":[{"k":"name","t":"GPT-6 Astra Pro","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"OpenAI","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"release","t":"2026-09-04","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"1050000","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"128000","s":["https://m